+menu "RuView Wi-Fi cipher policy"
+    config HOME_WIFI_ALLOW_LEGACY_SECURITY
+        bool "Allow insecure legacy WPA/TKIP compatibility"
+        default n
+        help
+            Permit the upstream WPA1/TKIP behavior. This disables the local
+            pre-handshake AES-only policy. Use only when explicitly required
+            for a legacy access point; prefer WPA2/WPA3 with AES instead.
+            It does not encrypt HTTP, MQTT, or other application traffic.
+endmenu
